docs/architecture/2026-05-16-crate-boundary-plan.md:255:No lower substrate may call a higher substrate. In particular, `identity` must not call `events`; `events` must not call `retrieval`, `working_memory`, `consolidation`, or `verification`; and `memory_graph` must not call `retrieval`.
