docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T52.md:49:- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/surfacing_tests.rs` — classification exhaustiveness, trusted/advisory partitioning, debug-assert guard, label-reason content, ranker exclusion.
