docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T03.md:12:This task fixes the crate layout and storage migration ordering before any Phase 1+ backend task writes code. It names the new crates (`lattice-identity`, `lattice-events`, `lattice-memory`, `lattice-retrieval`, `lattice-working-memory`, `lattice-consolidation`, `lattice-verification`) that will live under `daemon/crates/` (or documents the case for keeping each as a module inside `lattice-core` instead) and specifies the binding storage migration order plus rollback steps for every schema introduction in Phases 2 through 7. Without this contract, individual phase tasks would re-litigate boundaries and order, and migrations would be added in inconsistent ways.
