docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T72.md:36:4. Above the table render a filter bar with three controls: `Status` (multi-select over the eight statuses from §8), `Scope` (multi-select over `session`, `branch`, `repo`, `user`, `organization` from §4), `Class` (multi-select over the memory classes from §4 including `Observation`, `Decision`, `Constraint`, `Pattern`, `AntiPattern`, `WorkflowOutcome`, `FailurePattern`, `Procedure`, `Preference`, `ArchitectureInvariant`, `DocsContract`, `OpenQuestion`, `CounterMemory`). Each control is a `vscode.window.showQuickPick` invocation triggered from a button (no raw `<select>`); the chosen values post back to the webview which re-queries the bridge.
