docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T75.log:1684:This task delivers two diagnostic surfaces: the event trace view (operator-facing renderer for the append-only event log filtered by session/task/workspace) and the retrieval explanation view (renders the ranking scores + reasons emitted by the Phase 4 retrieval diagnostic mode). They are the surfaces operators use to answer two binding questions: "what actually happened in this session?" (event trace) and "why did this context get included and that other thing get excluded?" (retrieval explanation). Spec §10 lists both as required; spec §7 requires the ranker to expose scores and reasons in diagnostic mode, which is the data shape this UI consumes.
