docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T75.log:6183:docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T71.md:38:5. Create `extension/src/review/rpcBridge.ts` exporting a typed `ReviewRpcBridge` class wrapping the existing `daemon.ts` client. Expose typed methods for the new tools introduced in Phases 6–9 (memory inbox listing, promotion queue, contradiction queue, stale memory, evidence inspection, event trace, retrieval explanation, consolidation queue, indexing health, graph health). Every method returns a `Promise<Result>` shape with explicit error variants — never swallow errors (`coding.md` §Error handling).
