docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/T27.md:29:- `cd daemon && cargo build --release` was initially blocked by unrelated compile drift in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/event_capture.rs`: three payload initializers were missing the new `replay_snapshot_json` field. I added `replay_snapshot_json: None` to the `MemoryCreatedPayload`, `MemoryUpdatedPayload`, and `MemoryInvalidatedPayload` initializers so the required release build could pass.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/T36.md:33:- The existing event payload types did not carry included/excluded context diffs, so `MemoryRetrievedPayload` and `MemoryExpandedPayload` were extended with optional diff fields while preserving existing wire shapes when those fields are empty.
