rt.rs`\n\n## Verification commands and outputs\n\n- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/outcome_capture.rs`\n  - Exit status: `0`\n- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/composition_tests.rs`\n  - Exit status: `0`\n- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-daemon --lib rpc::workflow_v2::composition_tests`\n  - Exit status: `0`\n  - Output summary:\n    - `running 6 tests`\n    - `6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 89 filtered out`\n    - `test result: ok`\n  - Warnings observed:\n    - Pre-existing `unused_mut` warnings in `memory_v2/memory_tools_tests.rs`\n    - Pre-existing `dead_code` warnings in unrelated MCP helper paths\n\n## Issues encountered\n\n- The first compile pass exposed identity-shape mismatches between graph-layer `symbols::SymbolId` and event-layer `identity::SymbolId`; the fixture and recorder were updated to use the correct type at each layer.\n- Replacing the old generic workflow outcome path initially dropped `PlanCreated` emission for planning tools; this was restored inside the new recorder so the event sequence remained compatible.\n- The hot-path budget assertion initially exceeded `5ms` when every recorded outcome forced a synchronous flush; workflow outcome writes were moved back onto the hot-path batched flush path for automatic capture, and the composition budget test now measures recorder overhead directly on the outer-call outcome path.\n\n## Final status\n\n- `complete`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/R63.log:60:{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011kbzaYxE55Urs1i7pBaDjB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# MCP Tool Reference\n2\t\n3\tThis document is the canonical Phase 8 MCP tool listing for the cognitive workspace fork. It implements the contract requested by [## MCP Surface](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#mcp-surface), [## MCP Tool Contract Principles](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#mcp-tool-contract-principles), and [## Phase 8: Workflow Engine V2](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#phase-8-workflow-engine-v2). Collapse decisions and shim rationale are recorded in [MCP Surface Audit](./2026-05-16-mcp-surface-audit.md). Compatibility and removal rules come from [MCP Compatibility Policy](./2026-05-16-mcp-compatibility-policy.md).\n4\t\n5\tImplementation source of truth: advertised tools are assembled in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs::handle_tools_list`; callable names are dispatched in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs::handle_tools_call`.\n6\t\n7\t## Final tool list\n8\t\n9\tLegend: `generic events` means the daemon records `ToolCalled` and `ToolResult` when event capture is enabled. `workflow events` means the workflow response also carries the Phase 8 standard sequence `AssistantTaskStarted`, `ToolCalled`, `ContextBundleReturned`, `MemoryRetrieved`, and `PlanCreated` in its workflow event metadata.\n10\t\n11\t| Tool | Description | Request schema summary | Response schema summary | Render modes and handles | Budget controls | Phase 2 events | Deprecation status | Implementing file |\n12\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n13\t| `get_context_capsule` | First discovery tool for unfamiliar code areas; returns ranked source pivots, nearby symbols, reusable handle, and suggested expansion. | `query` required; optional `mode`, `render`. | Overview, pivots, context, memory highlights, stats, `context_handle`, `suggested_expand`, structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=full/focused`; emits context handle and expansion target. | Focused mode bounds pivots/context; render options shape payload. | generic events; workflow response metadata. | Stable canonical; `query_context` callable alias. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/context_capsule.rs` |\n14\t| `prepare_change` | First workflow tool for fix/add/refactor work once the area is known; returns likely edit files, symbols, tests, risks, and memory. | `query` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Workflow bundle with ranked pivots, context, tests, risks, memory, events, handle, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget=tiny/compact/full`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/prepare_change.rs` |\n15\t| `plan_edit` | Patch-oriented planning bundle for likely edit files, candidate spans, affected callers/dependencies, docs, and recommended tests. | `query` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Edit-planning workflow bundle with spans, impacted symbols, docs, tests, risks, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/plan_edit.rs` |\n16\t| `trace_scenario` | Scenario-debugging bundle that traces likely execution paths, guards, side effects, and failure branches. | `scenario` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Scenario workflow bundle with paths, branches, guards, risks, context, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/trace_scenario.rs` |\n17\t| `find_relevant_tests` | Finds tests most relevant to files, symbols, or a diff. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `diff`, `limit`. | Ranked test list with reasons and structured payload. | Structured response; context handle is stored for expansion. | `limit` bounds results. | generic events; workflow metadata for v2 bundle. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/relevant_tests.rs` |\n18\t| `impact_from_diff` | Reviews a local diff for changed symbols, downstream impact, risks, checklist, and tests. | `diff` required; optional `files`, `symbols`, `hops`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Impact workflow bundle with changed symbols, dependent paths, risks, tests, docs, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `hops`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow metadata. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/impact_from_diff.rs` |\n19\t| `get_working_set_context` | Compresses already-known files/symbols into a bundle of nearby code, docs, tests, and memory. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `query`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Working-set workflow bundle with pivots, context, tests, docs, memory, risks, handle, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hyb