"duplicate\".to_string()),\n277\t        )\n278\t        .unwrap();\n279\t\n280\t    assert_eq!(\n281\t        second,\n282\t        ReviewDecisionOutcome::AlreadyDecided {\n283\t            decision: ProposalDecision::Applied\n284\t        }\n285\t    );\n286\t}\n287\t\n288\t#[test]\n289\tfn decision_reason_column_round_trips() {\n290\t    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n291\t    let conn = Connection::open(&fixture.db_path).unwrap();\n292\t    initialize_schema(&conn).unwrap();\n293\t    let exists: i64 = conn\n294\t        .query_row(\n295\t            \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pragma_table_info('consolidation_proposals') WHERE name = 'decision_reason'\",\n296\t            [],\n297\t            |row| row.get(0),\n298\t        )\n299\t        .unwrap();\n300\t    assert_eq!(exists, 1);\n301\t\n302\t    conn.execute(\n303\t        \"INSERT INTO consolidation_jobs\n304\t            (job_id, workspace_id, kind, mode, status, enqueued_at)\n305\t         VALUES ('job-schema', 'workspace-main', 'schema', 'manual_review', 'proposed', 1)\",\n306\t        [],\n307\t    )\n308\t    .unwrap();\n309\t    conn.execute(\n310\t        \"INSERT INTO consolidation_proposals\n311\t            (proposal_id, job_id, target_memory_id, proposal_kind, prior_state, proposed_state,\n312\t             evidence, provenance_json, decision, decided_by, decision_reason)\n313\t         VALUES (?1, ?2, NULL, ?3, ?4, ?5, ?6, NULL, 'rejected', 'reviewer', 'schema-check')\",\n314\t        params![\n315\t            \"proposal-schema\",\n316\t            \"job-schema\",\n317\t            ProposalKind::CreateMemory.as_str(),\n318\t            \"{}\",\n319\t            \"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"repo\\\"}\",\n320\t            \"{}\"\n321\t        ],\n322\t    )\n323\t    .unwrap();\n324\t\n325\t    let record = ConsolidationProposal::load_record(&conn, \"proposal-schema\")\n326\t        .unwrap()\n327\t        .unwrap();\n328\t    assert_eq!(record.decision_reason.as_deref(), Some(\"schema-check\"));\n329\t}\n330\t\n331\tstruct Fixture {\n332\t    _dir: tempfile::TempDir,\n333\t    db_path: PathBuf,\n334\t    memory_store: MemoryStore,\n335\t    event_store: Arc<EventStore>,\n336\t    event_writer: EventWriter,\n337\t}\n338\t\n339\timpl Fixture {\n340\t    fn new() -> Self {\n341\t        let dir = tempdir().unwrap();\n342\t        let db_path = dir.path().join(\"consolidation.sqlite\");\n343\t        let event_store = Arc::new(EventStore::open_in_memory().unwrap());\n344\t        Self {\n345\t            memory_store: MemoryStore::open(&dir.path().join(\"memory.sqlite\")).unwrap(),\n346\t            event_store: event_store.clone(),\n347\t            event_writer: EventWriter::new(event_store, \"workspace-main\".to_string(), 4096),\n348\t            db_path,\n349\t            _dir: dir,\n350\t        }\n351\t    }\n352\t\n353\t    fn runtime(&self) -> ConsolidationJobRuntime {\n354\t        ConsolidationJobRuntime::new(\n355\t            Connection::open(&self.db_path).unwrap(),\n356\t            ConsolidationConfig::default(),\n357\t        )\n358\t        .unwrap()\n359\t    }\n360\t\n361\t    fn review_queue(&self) -> ReviewQueue<'_> {\n362\t        let conn = Box::leak(Box::new(Connection::open(&self.db_path).unwrap()));\n363\t        ReviewQueue::new(conn, &self.memory_store, &self.event_writer)\n364\t    }\n365\t\n366\t    fn operator(&self, value: &str) -> OperatorId {\n367\t        OperatorId {\n368\t            value: value.to_string(),\n369\t        }\n370\t    }\n371\t\n372\t    fn set_enqueued_at(&self, job_id: &str, enqueued_at: i64) {\n373\t        let conn = Connection::open(&self.db_path).unwrap();\n374\t        conn.execute(\n375\t            \"UPDATE consolidation_jobs SET enqueued_at = ?1 WHERE job_id = ?2\",\n376\t            params![enqueued_at, job_id],\n377\t        )\n378\t        .unwrap();\n379\t    }\n380\t\n381\t    fn memory_consolidated_event(&self) -> crate::events::EventEnvelope {\n382\t        let reader = EventReader::new(self.event_store.clone());\n383\t        EventQuery::new()\n384\t            .workspace(\"workspace-main\")\n385\t            .branch(\"main\")\n386\t            .kind(EventKind::MemoryConsolidated)\n387\t            .execute(&reader)\n388\t            .unwrap()\n389\t            .into_iter()\n390\t            .next()\n391\t            .unwrap()\n392\t    }\n393\t}\n394\t\n395\tfn job_for_scope(scope: &str) -> ConsolidationJobSpec {\n396\t    ConsolidationJobSpec {\n397\t        job_id: format!(\"job-{scope}\"),\n398\t        workspace_id: \"workspace-main\".to_string(),\n399\t        kind: format!(\"scope-{scope}\"),\n400\t        mode: ConsolidationJobMode::ManualReview,\n401\t        proposal: Some(PendingProposalSpec {\n402\t            proposal_id: format!(\"proposal-{scope}\"),\n403\t            target_memory_id: None,\n404\t            proposal_kind: ProposalKind::CreateMemory,\n405\t            prior_state: json!({}),\n406\t            proposed_state: proposal_state_for_scope(scope),\n407\t            evidence: json!({\"source_memory_ids\":[]}),\n408\t            provenance: None,\n409\t        }),\n410\t    }\n411\t}\n412\t\n413\tfn proposal_state_for_scope(scope: &str) -> Value {\n414\t    match scope {\n415\t        \"organization\" => json!({\n416\t            \"scope\": \"organization\",\n417\t            \"memory\": { \"scope\": \"organization\" }\n418\t        }),\n419\t        _ => {\n420\t            let legacy_scope = match scope {\n421\t                \"session\" => MemoryScope::Session,\n422\t                \"branch\" => MemoryScope::Branch,\n423\t                \"repo\" => MemoryScope::Repo,\n424\t                other => panic!(\"unsupported scope: {other}\"),\n425\t            };\n426\t            let mut value = serde_json::to_value(ConsolidationMemoryState {\n427\t                memory: Memory {\n428\t                    id: format!(\"mem-proposal-{scope}\"),\n429\t                    session_id: \"session-main\".to_string(),\n430\t                    content: format!(\"{scope} memory\"),\n431\t                    memory_type: MemoryType::Observation,\n432\t                    scope: legacy_scope,\n433\t                    confidence: 0.9,\n434\t                    linked_symbols: Vec::new(),\n435\t                    linked_files: Vec::new(),\n436\t                    workspace_id: Some(\"workspace-main\".to_string()),\n437\t                    branch: Some(\"main\".to_string()),\n438\t                    refresh_key: Some(format!(\"refresh-{scope}\")),\n439\t                    source_query: Some(\"review queue test\".to_string()),\n440\t                    created_at: 1,\n441\t                    last_accessed: 1,\n442\t                    access_count: 0,\n443\t                    is_stale: false,\n444\t                    stale_reason: None,\n445\t                },\n446\t                structured_fields: crate::memory::MemoryStructuredFields::default(),\n447\t                last_verified_at: None,\n448\t                memory_links: Vec::new(),\n449\t            })\n450\t            .unwrap();\n451\t            value[\"scope\"] = Value::String(scope.to_string());\n452\t            value\n453\t        }\n454\t    }\n455\t}\n456\t\n457\tfn proposal_decision(path: &PathBuf, proposal_id: &str) -> String {\n458\t    let conn = Connection::open(path).unwrap();\n459\t    conn.query_row(\n460\t        \"SELECT decision FROM consolidation_proposals WHERE proposal_id = ?1\",\n461\t        params![proposal_id],\n462\t        |row| row.get(0),\n463\t    )\n464\t    .unwrap()\n465\t}\n466\t\n467\tfn proposal_decision_reason(path: &PathBuf, proposal_id: &str) -> Option<String> {\n468\t    let conn = Connection::open(path).unwrap();\n469\t    conn.query_row(\n470\t        \"SELECT decision_reason FROM consolidation_proposals WHERE proposal_id = ?1\",\n471\t        params![proposal_id],\n472\t        |row| row.get(0),\n473\t    )\n474\t    .unwrap()\n475\t}\n476\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67f9c4ff-29cf-4b48-8541-b2a63bf25834","uuid":"b0902dca-b28a-4ad5-b2e4-b64802da8193","timestamp":"2026-05-17T11:43:19.837Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/review_queue_tests.rs","content":"use std::path::PathBuf;\nuse std::sync::Arc;\n\nuse rusqlite::{params, Connection};\nuse serde_json::{json, Value};\nuse tempfile::tempdir;\n\nuse super::*;\nuse crate::events::{EventKind, EventPayload, EventQuery, EventReader, EventStore, EventWriter};\nuse crate::identity::OperatorId;\nuse crate::memory::{Memory, MemoryScope, MemoryStore, MemoryType};\n\n#[test]\nfn session_scope_proposal_is_not_gated_and_auto_applies() {\n    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n    let mut runtime = fixture.runtime();\n    runtime.submit(job_for_scope(\"session\")).unwrap();\n\n    let proposals = runtime\n        .execute_ready(\n            &fixture.memory_store,\n            &fixture.event_writer,\n            &fixture.operator(\"auto-policy\"),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n\n    assert_eq!(proposals.len(), 1);\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-session\"),\n        \"applied\"\n    );\n    assert_eq!(fixture.memory_store.list_all().unwrap().len(), 1);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn branch_scope_proposal_is_not_gated_and_auto_applies() {\n    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n    let mut runtime = fixture.runtime();\n    runtime.submit(job_for_scope(\"branch\")).unwrap();\n\n    runtime\n        .execute_ready(\n            &fixture.memory_store,\n            &fixture.event_writer,\n            &fixture.operator(\"auto-policy\"),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-branch\"),\n        \"applied\"\n    );\n    assert_eq!(fixture.memory_store.list_all().unwrap().len(), 1);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn repo_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending() {\n    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n    let mut runtime = fixture.runtime();\n    runtime.submit(job_for_scope(\"repo\")).unwrap();\n\n    runtime\n        .execute_ready(\n            &fixture.memory_store,\n            &fixture.event_writer,\n            &fixture.operator(\"auto-policy\"),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-repo\"),\n        \"pending\"\n    );\n    assert_eq!(fixture.memory_store.list_all().unwrap().len(), 0);\n    let queue = fixture.review_queue();\n    let items = queue\n        .list_pending(\"workspace-main\", &ReviewQueueFilter::default())\n        .unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(items.len(), 1);\n    assert_eq!(items[0].scope, crate::memory_graph::MemoryScope::Repo);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn organization_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending() {\n    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n    let mut runtime = fixture.runtime();\n    runtime.submit(job_for_scope(\"organization\")).unwrap();\n\n    runtime\n        .execute_ready(\n            &fixture.memory_store,\n            &fixture.event_writer,\n            &fixture.operator(\"auto-policy\"),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-organization\"),\n        \"pending\"\n    );\n    assert_eq!(fixture.memory_store.list_all().unwrap().len(), 0);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn decide_apply_routes_through_proposal_apply_and_records_operator() {\n    let fixture = Fixture::new();\n    let mut runtime = fixture.runtime();\n    runtime.submit(job_for_scope(\"repo\")).unwrap();\n    runtime\n        .execute_ready(\n            &fixture.memory_store,\n            &fixture.event_writer,\n            &fixture.operator(\"auto-policy\"),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n    let queue = fixture.review_queue();\n\n    let outcome = queue\n        .decide(\n            \"proposal-repo\",\n            ProposalDecision::Applied,\n            &fixture.operator(\"reviewer-1\"),\n            Some(\"promote durable fact\".to_string()),\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n\n    match outcome {\n        ReviewDecisionOutcome::Applied { outcome } => {\n            assert_eq!(\n                outcome,\n                ApplyOutcome::Applied {\n                    memory_id: \"mem-proposal-repo\".to_string()\n                }\n            );\n        }\n        other => panic!(\"unexpected outcome: {other:?}\"),\n    }\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-repo\"),\n        \"applied\"\n    );\n    assert_eq!(\n        proposal_decision_reason(&fixture.db_path, \"proposal-repo\").as_deref(),\n        Some(\"promote durable fact\")\n    );\n    let event = fixture.memory_consolidated_event();\n    match event.payload {\n        EventPayload::MemoryConsolidated(payload) => {\n            assert_eq!(payload.decided_by.as_deref(), Some(\"reviewer-1\"));\n            assert_eq!(\n                payload.decision_reason.as_deref(),\n                Some(\"promote durable fact\")\n            );\n            assert_eq!(payload.proposal_id.as_deref(), Some(\"proposal-repo\"));\n        }\n        _ => panic!(\"expected memory_consolidated\"),\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn decide_reject_leaves_memory_unchanged_and_records_rejection() 2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T23.log:223294:+        EventPayload::MemoryInvalidated(MemoryInvalidatedPayload { memory_id, reason, .. })
