docs/architecture/2026-05-16-mcp-tool-reference.md:54:| `get_task_memory` | Reads working memory plus relevant durable memory for the current task. | `task_id` required; optional `intent_hint`, `budget_tokens`. | Task memory bundle with inclusion reasons, verification/freshness/conflict state, and expansion handles. | Full structured bundle with memory expansion handles. | `budget_tokens` clips memory payload. | generic events; `MemoryRetrieved`. | Stable canonical Phase 8 memory tool. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/get_task_memory.rs` |
