docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R47-consolidation.md:18:- **Manual review mode for high-impact repo or organization memories.** Implemented by `ReviewQueue::should_gate` + `enqueue` + `decide` (`review_queue.rs:96-241`). `ConsolidationJobRuntime::run_job` calls `ReviewQueue::should_gate(&proposal)` before auto-applying (`mod.rs:402-413`) so repo/organization-scope proposals stay pending. Test coverage: `repo_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending` and `organization_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending` (`review_queue_tests.rs:56-102`). Session and branch scope auto-apply: `session_scope_proposal_is_not_gated_and_auto_applies`, `branch_scope_proposal_is_not_gated_and_auto_applies` (`review_queue_tests.rs:13-54`).
