docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R47-consolidation.md:124:The spec is explicit: "No consolidation job may silently rewrite high-scope memory without preserving provenance and prior state." Operationally this means every write to `MemoryStore` from inside `consolidation/` must go through `ConsolidationProposal::apply` (when applying a decision) or `ReplayDriver::reverse` / `ReplayDriver::apply_reverse_state` (when replaying or undoing).
